  "comments": "According to Las chen, one time at Byang ngam ring, mKhan chen Phyogs rgyal ba was refuting Rig gter (ID: 5564) and no one was able to give an answer, but mKhas grub overwhelmed him with his arguments based on scriptures and reasoning ([BKUHJCNA]: 732).\r\n\r\nAccording to PaN chen, he became renowned as mKhas grub chos rje in all regions due to being the rebirth (sku'i skye ba) of mKhas grub Lha dbang blo or Devendrabuddhi (ID: 5554) ([E9XCQDGQ]: 99).",
